  "meistens": {"lemma":"meistens","pos":"Adverb","en":"mostly / usually","ur":"aam tor par","ex":{"de":"Meistens drei bis vier Tage.","en":"Usually three to four days.","ur":"Aam tor par teen chaar din."}},
